Exclusion Criteria:

1. Other active malignancies within 2 years prior to the first dose of investigational product. Localized tumors that have been cured, such as basal cell carcinoma, squamous-cell skin cancer, superficial bladder carcinoma, prostate carcinoma in situ, cervical carcinoma in situ, breast cancer in situ, etc., are acceptable;
