* 9)Patients who require chronic oral administration of aspirin or other non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs, clopidogrel and other drugs that inhibit platelet aggregation (except for patients who meet the inclusion criteria who can suspend the treatment as assessed by the investigator);
